    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Deaweedajeega haleanjeeda siitaw NG'UTAMIIDA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eeshiina fuga Israeli, Iigeanda siida radanyeanda abeeda gurooruunatkeaba fiisu gaygaba NG'UTAMIIDA aba mooneeda lapiyeeda jea eatayda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda mooneadaang'u jea adayda gaygaba ng'eedeeda gweanyeeka atiktam ea ghwahita gweanyeew laadam gaygaba shiliingaji haradam ea damanamughuush, deena mooneeda shiliingajeega ghooriida ghaydit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida ii gatmooda gil, abeeda mooneadaang'u gajea shiliingaji diktam ea damanamughuushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida iideepa ghang'eada gweanyeew muut ea ghwahita gweanyeew diktam, abeeda mooneadaang'u gaygaba ng'eedeeda ak gaygaba shiliingaji diktam, nea gatmooda gaygaba shiliingaji damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida iibea sheanagi ea ghwahita gweanyeew muut, mooneadaang'u gajea shiliingaji muut gil aba ng'eedeeda nea aba gatmooda mooneadaang'u gajea shiliingaji samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida iideepa gaba gweanyeew laadam ghana ghwanaawa, abeeda mooneadaang'u gajea shiliingaji damanamuut gil aba ng'eedeeda, nea aba gatmooda gaygaba shiliingaji damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadeepa siida ea bwarbwar muuchi ea ghwaraay gagu mooneadaang'u, abeeda gaygweadu siida madeeda ashoohoocheanda, ak gayghoamwanaay ashoohoocheanda mooneadaanyi; deena uurdaanyi siidida rat gidean ak gayghoamwanaay ashoohoocheanda mooneadaanyi jea ghoadayda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amadeepa ea diyeayda uurji dea adayiida siida ghoah haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA, haleanjeedida sean adaw siida NG'UTAMIIDEAN gajea ghaydit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niny mayghwayam gida wasean ghana gooyamuuji gida wassean, gidamiy ea gidamuy, ghana gidamuy ea gidamiy; amadeepa gooyamuuji gida wasean was diyeayda ea diyeayda, abeeda duwaaw gidida siyamuuji ea nirjean gajea ghaydit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadeepa ea diyeayda mii miyi was dea mwajeaghadoawanda ghoah haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA, abeeda gaygweadu siida deeda madeeda ashoohoocheanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gaygwasikteawa ashoohoocheanda ghwadaah aamiy ea muy; ak abeeda ang'iing'i, ashoohoocheanda, gajadeena mooneeda, ak gaygwasnu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagasa gootini, abeeda gayghoahaat gilagi aba jeeda gilamuut aba sheayeeda, aba jeeda damanamughuush.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea siida iyadayda gheanyi ghoadaw dea ghaydit bea NG'UTAMIIDA, gaygwasikteawa ashoohoocheanda mooneadaanyi aamiy ghana ea muy; mooneeda rugu ashoohoocheanda, gaygwasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagasa siida adayda giitinoodeaba gheanyi, gayghoahaat gideaba muut bea mooneeda sishaaha aba shiliingajeega, ak gayghoah daanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea siida iyadaw NG'UTAMIIDA weasta ng'eanyiida was daanyi ghayi hearan, abeeda mooneadaang'u gaygalana gichea gwajiilda; gweerajeega nganooyda siguura shayiiri gajeenung' gaba shiliingaji haradam ea damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama adayda madamnyeandaanyi iing'ata gweayda giitinooda, abeeda mooneeda gaygabeachi gidirgu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea iyadayda madamnyeandaanyi nea ning'ata gweayda giitinooda, abeeda gaygoodeen ashoohoocheanda mooneeda lapiya gala geat sea gweanyeeka siipuut aba hiteayda gweayda giitinooda, abeeda gajeasuuy aba mooneadaang'u irugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda iigasa siida adayda madamnyeanda gootini, abeeda gayghoahaat gideaba muut aba jeeda mooneeda lapiyeeda madamnyeanda, ak gayghoah daanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iimagassa gootini madamnyeanda, ghana ea nishaayda madamnyeanda aba hichpa siinuut, abeeda ea maygudu eamu eetin earahay; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea madamnyeanda, iisiiteelu damanda giitinooda, abeeda gajeaghaydit aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea gawuurji madamnyeanda sisach; abeeda gaygaba ashoohoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iyadaw NG'UTAMIIDA madamnyeanda ghayi shaah, nea mawoosa dea nyas aba hearaniischooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gaygoodeen ashoohoocheanda mooneadaanyi ea ghwahita gweayda giitinooda, ak gayghoadayda siidida giteena mooneeda aba damandida, nea ghwanung' ghoah gidaghaydit bea NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gweayda giitinooda gaygabiikta madamnyeanda heeda siida ghayi sishaaha, was siida ghayi bea ng'eanyiida aba hearanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giliwas sheayeeda gajeegala shiliingajeega ghooriida ghaydit: abeeda mooneeda gera gajea diktam aba shiliingajeanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea duweachajeega diyeanga gaba NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ea manda siida jea ghoadayda; ada ea heeyda gil ghana ea gisilleanda, gaba NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadeepa ea diyeayda mideawa sirjeeda, abeeda gaygabiikta ghwasha aba mooneadaang'u, ak ghoahaat gilagi aba jeeda gilamuut; ghana, amadeepa ea meetina, abeeda geeshaayda aba mooneadaang'u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
