            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak ea manda gida jea eatayda jea ghoadaw siida NG'UTAMIIDA, aba jeeda gida wasean mideawa, adagaba siida ghana diyeayda, ghana gaba madamnyeanda hearan, gajeashaayda ghana eetin; gida wasean siitayda gajea ghaydit muuchi aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea manda gidasiitayda, jea eenuus aba jeeda buuneeda, gajeetin; ak abeeda gajeenuus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gaygeani gilagi aba jeeda gilatamanamughuush bea booga sean bea madamnyeanda, ada ea booga ghana ea haghweega, gaygaba NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iideepa gagasa siida gootini gida wasean ghayi adayda was haleanjeadaanyi ghadoowanda, abeeda gayghoahaat gideaba muut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea haleanjeeda sean ghadeawanda was dugwa ghana ea hawaniga nooga, gilinyoo ea diyeaydeaba damanamughuush siihaaghwiida bileangida jeagiischoocheanda, gajea ghaydit aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida maygagasa ak ea maygang'ula aamiy ghana eamuy, ak ea maygooyamuuji; ama ayamuuji, abeeda haleanjeeni duwaawiin was gidida ea dea siyamuujiin gajea ghaydidi; ak ea majeetin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
